    "PLO13",
    "PLO12"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>Explain the <strong data-end=\"3438\" data-start=\"3394\">working of password-based authentication</strong> in an OS.</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 507,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 13252
  },
  {
   "_id": 13256,
   "ANSWER": "<ul data-end=\"1625\" data-start=\"1403\">\n\t<li data-end=\"2937\" data-start=\"2832\">\n\t<p data-end=\"2937\" data-start=\"2834\"><strong data-end=\"2859\" data-start=\"2834\">Symmetric encryption:</strong> Same key for encryption &amp; decryption; faster but needs secure key exchange.</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3074\" data-start=\"2938\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3074\" data-start=\"2940\"><strong data-end=\"2966\" data-start=\"2940\">Asymmetric encryption:</strong> Uses a public key for encryption and a private key for decryption; more secure for key exchange but slower.</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC202J",
   "LEVEL": 4,
   "OUTCOMES": [
